Dear Marina, 

I'm pleased to know things are getting better.There is a syntax error in your command line:
CM <- read.structure(file "CMinput.str"), n.ind=151, n.loc=9,
should read:
CM <- read.structure(file="CMinput.str", n.ind=151, n.loc=9,  # ... etc.

So far, there is no special handling of null alleles in adegenet. I guess most input files would indicate null alleles by NAs, at least in the case of microsatellites.

Best regards,

Thibaut. 
